## Pre-commit hook

Release versions of the generator include the Maven pre-commit hook from
`onecx/onecx-ai-workflows` in `.githooks/pre-commit`. Local generator builds
without the bundled hook warn and omit this file.

The generator initializes a Git repository if needed and enables the hook
automatically with `git config --local core.hooksPath .githooks`. No manual
activation is required.

The hook runs Maven QA checks when `CI` or `FORCE_CI_COMMIT_HOOKS` is set.
Local commits otherwise skip these checks.
